# Pairs with ListedInSink. A publish skips its sink manifest write, so a fresh
# publish of an id a retire removed registers a row the sink cannot back.
MODULE: ListedInSinkManifestNotWritten
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a publish registers a row without writing its manifest
PERTURBS: PubMan

--- FIND
    /\ man' = ScopeOf(c)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the manifest is not written.
    /\ UNCHANGED man
--- END
